Research-Only Licensing (Noncommercial)
======================================

This repository is distributed under a split noncommercial license model.

1) Source code license (noncommercial)
--------------------------------------
Unless otherwise noted, source code in this repository is licensed under:

  PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0
  https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0/

This includes, by default, files in:
- /ccd
- /baselines
- /scripts
- /tests
- build/config files (e.g., Makefile, pyproject.toml, requirements, environment)

2) Data, documentation, and model-artifact license (noncommercial)
------------------------------------------------------------------
Dataset files, benchmark assets, model artifacts, and documentation are licensed under:

  Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
  Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

This includes, by default, files in:
- /hostname_injection_benchmark
- /caho_model_checkpoint
- documentation and paper artifacts (e.g., *.md, *.pdf)

3) Commercial use
-----------------
Commercial use is not permitted under these licenses.
If you need commercial rights, contact the repository maintainers to obtain a
separate commercial license.

4) Scope and precedence
-----------------------
If a file or subdirectory contains a more specific license notice, that specific
notice controls for that file/subdirectory.
